    {
      "id": "1766271d-24af-4cb8-ab9e-44a337e040ca",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        352,
        912
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 864,
        "content": "## Research Paper Scraper\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow takes a research topic from a chat message, uses Groq-powered LLM steps to turn it into refined search queries, and searches Google Scholar via SerpAPI. It flattens the search results, checks for existing DOIs, enriches missing DOI data through CrossRef, then merges and deduplicates all papers. The final cleaned list is appended to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the chat trigger so users can submit research topics to the workflow.\n- Add valid Groq credentials for both LangChain model nodes used by the LLM chain and information extractor.\n- Configure SerpAPI credentials for the Google Scholar search node.\n- Review the CrossRef HTTP request URL and parameters; add a contact email or user agent if required by your CrossRef usage policy.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the target spreadsheet, sheet, and column mappings for the append step.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the query-refinement code, SerpAPI search parameters, CrossRef matching logic, wait interval, deduplication rules, and Google Sheets columns to fit the research domain and desired output format."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a33ed40f-4e44-4275-8831-1092205ff527",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        912,
        912
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 592,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "## Receive chat request\n\nStarts the workflow from an incoming chat message and runs the initial Groq-powered LLM chain to interpret the user’s research request."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9a9952ec-1dfd-46c9-80e0-00093a54c499",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1536,
        928
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 656,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Extract search queries\n\nUses an information extractor with a Groq chat model to pull structured search terms, then sets and refines those queries for downstream paper searching."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "292b75b2-3018-4ba0-85cd-40a81f96b2a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2224,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 624,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Search Scholar results\n\nQueries Google Scholar through SerpAPI, flattens the returned paper results, and branches based on whether each item already has a DOI."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "88d19520-5f38-49cb-8fb6-daff5d05b3c3",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2560,
        1296
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 912,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Enrich missing DOIs\n\nProcesses papers without DOIs in batches, waits between requests, calls the CrossRef API, and combines CrossRef metadata back with the original Scholar data."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b14d0026-6323-479f-84ca-c168092ee13e",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3104,
        928
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 672,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Deduplicate and save\n\nMerges DOI-ready and CrossRef-enriched records, removes duplicate papers, and appends the final cleaned research paper list to Google Sheets."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
